&lt;p>&lt;strong>秋日登高，尽览终南秀色&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>南五台作为终南山的著名胜景，以“奇峰、古寺、云海、秋色”闻名。活动当日，天高云淡，微风拂面，正是登高的好时节。大家沿着山径拾级而上，虽山路蜿蜒、台阶陡峭，但成员们相互鼓励、彼此扶持，一路欢声笑语，共同向山顶进发。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>
&lt;figure class="lab-content-figure" >
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100">&lt;img alt="风景1"
srcset="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/02_hu14661443526037541489.webp 400w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/02_hu11500582303907431924.webp 760w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/02_hu11889756189606059387.webp 1200w"
