src="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/02_hu11500582303907431924.webp"
width="760"
height="570"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/figure>
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>行至高处，远眺层峦叠嶂，群山连绵，秋叶斑斓，云雾缭绕间尽显终南山的壮阔与灵秀。山顶红墙金顶的古建筑在苍翠与秋黄的交织中格外醒目，大家纷纷驻足，用镜头记录下这秀美的自然风光与攀登的喜悦。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>
&lt;figure class="lab-content-figure" >
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100">&lt;img alt="风景2"
srcset="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/03_hu1463548463833267012.webp 400w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/03_hu15002009858470253597.webp 760w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/03_hu13569210580765048330.webp 1200w"
